---
title: "2024-12-31"
navigationTitle: "2024-12-31"
---

We've added the `upgrade_date` field to the [`Subscriber`](/api-subscribers-introduction) model. This field is a date that indicates the date on which the subscriber upgraded to a paid subscription.

Not only that, you can also [filter subscribers](/api-subscribers-list) by their upgrade date, or sort them by it.
